xpecting him to significantly outperform those numbers in 2026-27.","player":8483512.0,"return":"2026-11-24","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"EDM"},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Frederik Andersen","note":"Andersen, who signed a one-year, $1 million contract with Edmonton in July, is still rehabbing from a knee injury. He posted a 16-14-5 record with a 3.05 GAA and an .874 save percentage in 35 appearances for Carolina during the 2025-26 regular season. Once he's ready to play in the 2026-27 campaign with the Oilers, Andersen could compete for starts with Tristan Jarry and Devon Levi.","player":8475883.0,"return":"2026-12-30","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"EDM"},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Mattias Janmark","note":"Janmark underwent an undisclosed procedure earlier in the year, but he's currently shelved until further notice. The 33-year-old winger was limited in 2025-26, where he compiled a goal and eight points across 43 regular-season outings. In his absence, Mathieu Joseph and Max Jones are expected to serve as the team's left wingers in the bottom six to open the 2026-27 campaign.","player":8477406.0,"return":"2026-10-26","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"EDM"},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Atro Leppanen","note":"ir-nr","player":NaN,"return":"2026-10-31","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"EDM"},{"date":"2026-10-19","name":"Olli Maatta","note":"Maatta missed his second straight game Sunday against Columbus and doesn't have a clear timeline for a return to game action. The left-shot blueliner didn't practice Saturday, so he might not be that close to suiting up in a game, but it's at least positive that he will travel with the team. Minnesota's road trip begins Tuesday in Edmonton and concludes Oct. 27 in Utah.","player":8476874.0,"return":"2026-10-27","src":"ESPN","status":"Out","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-10-19","name":"Jared Spurgeon","note":"Spurgeon hasn't been in the lineup since Oct. 12 and was placed on injured reserve earlier Sunday due to his upper-body injury. It wasn't made explicitly clear by head coach John Hynes if Spurgeon will play on the road trip, but the fact that he is traveling is a good sign. Minnesota's final game on the road before returning home will be in Utah on Oct. 27.","player":8474716.0,"return":"2026-10-27","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-10-18","name":"Filip Gustavsson","note":"Gustavsson was moved to long-term injured reserve earlier in October, so Sunday's update isn't particularly surprising. The 28-year-old netminder recently began skating on his own, but he still has several steps to take in his recovery before he's in the mix to return to game action. Jesper Wallstedt and Calvin Pickard should continue to handle goaltending duties in Gustavsson's absence.","player":8479406.0,"return":"2026-11-19","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-10-12","name":"Marcus Foligno","note":"ir","player":8475220.0,"return":"2026-10-29","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Nick Foligno","note":"ir","player":8473422.0,"return":"2026-10-29","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-09-29","name":"Brock Faber","note":"Faber left Friday's preseason contest against the Stars in the second period with his confirmed skull fracture. The 24-year-old's status will be closely monitored in the coming days until a timetable for his return is provided. Faber's role is not one that can be easily filled, as he exploded for 15 goals, 51 points, 173 shots on net and 148 blocked shots across 80 regular-season games in the 2025-26 campaign. He's a worthy candidate to occupy the IR spot in fantasy until he's able to return to Minnesota's top defensive pairing.","player":8482122.0,"return":"2026-11-03","src":"ESPN","status":"Injured Reserve","team":"MIN"},{"date":"2026-08-26","name":"Frederik Andersen","note":"Knee: The Oilers announced